Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At times through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.01,0:01:53.68,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(684,726,\1a&H00&)}Enter: Sanji
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.01,0:01:53.68,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Enter: Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:01:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was way off the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's so loud down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cannon firing practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not going very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, let the expert aim the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from the flying distance of\Nthe last one, this should do it. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hit that thing on the\Nfirst try! Wow, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.36,0:02:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you think I'm pretty magnificent when
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it comes to aiming so\Nare you impressed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you better believe\Nit So it's all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be our sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get to be captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm still the captain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever I'll hear me you for now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the second you do something cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking your post I can live with that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know guys I was\Nthinking there's one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other position that we\Nhave to fill before we
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can head out for the\NGrand Line You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.84,0:02:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kitchen is really nice on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just pay me and I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it is vital for long trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No decent pirate ship\Nshould be without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:02:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A musician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think we're doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when I thought you were\Ngonna say something smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're pirates and pirates\Nsing a lot, didn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out here, you damn pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who I am means nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stinking pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then just let him handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over the years, I've lost count of\Nall the pirate heads we've taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you guys think\Nyou can kill my partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know what this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stop wrecking my ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:04:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Johnny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's saying my name like they\Nthink they know me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Big Bro Zoro! Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here big bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey relax. Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Yosaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, Zoro knows that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up until a few days ago, he\Nwas healthy and full of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.34,0:04:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, he keeps fainting\Nand getting really pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's causing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His teeth had been falling out and his\Nold wound opened up and started bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just got worse and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I thought maybe we'd just\Nrest on a little island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cannonball came flying from this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry isn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro, give it to me straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're doing, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mocking his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Usopp, we have\Nsome limes in storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring them here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got scurvy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.10,0:06:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scurvy? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we weren't too late, he'll\Nbe just fine in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Big Sis? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.96,0:06:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm not a magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This used to be a hopeless\Ndisease that plagued sailors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we just know how to deal with it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink up, sick guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is caused by a simple deficiency of\Nplant-derived nutrients, like vitamin C.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in the old days, they couldn't\Ncarry fresh fruits and vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because they couldn't store them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a little is good, a lot is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:06:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're like a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now, how about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She isn't dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every sailor should know about scurvy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It scared me! Hooray! You're all better!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't kill that quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow us to introduce ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm Yosaku.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.98,0:07:39.86,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(433,475,\1a&H00&)}Johnny and Yosaku\NBounty Hunter Duo
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.98,0:07:39.86,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(433,475,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Johnny and Yosaku\NBounty Hunter Duo
Dialogue: 3,0:07:34.98,0:07:39.86,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Johnny and Yosaku\NBounty Hunter Duo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, we're the baddest pirate\Nbounty hunting duo in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Zoro there used to be one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Small world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never thought I'd see you guys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you think you're surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never imagined that the pirate\Nhunter Zoro became a pirate himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:07:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let this be a lesson to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is the kind of trouble you run\Ninto when you choose a life on the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means when we're at sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we really gotta think\Nabout how we can get the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right amount of nutrients\Nwith very little food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely necessary that someone\Non the ship knows how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, the ship needs a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go find a seafaring cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have yummy food even\Nwhile we're out at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.08,0:08:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know just the place, and the\Nfood is going to blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider yourselves warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is close to the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've heard a lot\Nof rumors lately that a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,certain Hawkeye man you're\Nlooking for is there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set a course North-North-East.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our destination is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea restaurant, Baratie!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.72,0:09:42.31,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)}Baratie\NThe Sea Restaurant
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.72,0:09:42.31,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Baratie\NThe Sea Restaurant
Dialogue: 3,0:09:38.72,0:09:42.31,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Baratie\NThe Sea Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's a big fish! How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the coolest place ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I told you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A marine ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.88,0:10:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, they're not going\Nto start firing at us, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how did that ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen that pirate flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, do you think he knows that you\Nand I aren't a couple of pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.48,0:10:34.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord4.8\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Lieutenant "Ironfist" Fullbody\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:10:28.48,0:10:34.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Lieutenant "Ironfist" Fullbody\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 3,0:10:28.48,0:10:34.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,630)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Lieutenant "Ironfist" Fullbody\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.34,0:10:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Iron Fist Fullbody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can just call me sir.\NYou there! Who's the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Usopp. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only made our flag\Nthe day before yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I drew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:10:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're that bounty hunter duo that\Ngoes after the small fish, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you've finally been caught by pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.78,0:11:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, actually, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, baby, let's get going. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think small-type bounty\Nhunters would go after these guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go to that restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sink them. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ignored us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time we see him, he better\Nhave a little more respect for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, those are all wanted\Npirates, big sis not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, if we defeat\Nthem, we get the reward money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty lucrative business, huh, big sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're aiming right at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's range on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Head Chef Zep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head Chef, are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.34,0:13:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.34,0:13:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get back to the restaurant already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, but sir, aren't you,\NI mean... You maggots!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to see me angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feeding the customers is a cook's job!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put me out of business?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I'm very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to know!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.27,0:13:55.52,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord4.8\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)}Head Chef & Proprietor Zeff\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 2,0:13:51.27,0:13:55.52,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Head Chef & Proprietor Zeff\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 3,0:13:51.27,0:13:55.52,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,630)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Head Chef & Proprietor Zeff\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm all banged up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:14:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The medical fees and repair charges\Nfor the ship are gonna cost you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't ask you to cut me any slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'M FLAT BROKE! Hm. Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're pretty direct, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't have money,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've no choice but to work. Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna make it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll work,\Nunpaid, for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you off the hook with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A year?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just say a year?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A whole year?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's taking Luffy so long? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.58,0:14:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll probably make him work\Nwithout pay for like a whole month.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should have just\Nsaid it was the Marine's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fault instead of being so freaking honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy sitting over there\Nis Lieutenant Full Body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.50,0:15:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big shot from HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody in here is looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all admiring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.23,0:15:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yes, the aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the unmistakable scent from\Nthe soil of Mock of the Northland,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bitter with plenty of\Nbody and just a tad sour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This wine must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the famous Ituruts Burgerstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.56,0:15:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.24,0:15:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even close, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dish is best when hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, sir, my name's\NSanji. I'm the Zeus chef.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.24,0:16:15.62,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)}Sous-Chef Sanji\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 2,0:16:11.24,0:16:15.62,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Sous-Chef Sanji\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 3,0:16:11.24,0:16:15.62,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Sous-Chef Sanji\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the waiters ran off as of yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.20,0:16:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks so confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems my sense of\Ntaste isn't working today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain I requested\Nthat the owner serve
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that particular wine when\NI made this reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only work for one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A week, get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:16:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, then. Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you wrecked my restaurant and\Nseriously injured the head chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a serious offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just settle that up with\None or two weeks of unpaid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous. You win three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.22,0:17:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited ten long years\Nto become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'm not gonna waste another\Nyear stuck in this restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you to let\Nme off the hook in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my decision. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you value your time so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what you can do\Nto settle your debt quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.72,0:17:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll cost you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a leg, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's pricey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, I got your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.66,0:18:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiter! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe I've already\Ntold you I'm not a waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an irresistible beauty you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lady, would you care to join\Nme elsewhere for a glass of wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.02,0:18:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is bug soup on the menu today, or did\Nyou make it just for me? Bug soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this bug doing there, waiter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to ruin the\Nrestaurant's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir. Don't know, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.08,0:18:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, it kind of looks like he's\Ndrowning, but it's hard to say for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have eaten it if you\Nhad just taken the bug out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.42,0:19:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have been wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took three full days of hard\Ncooking to prepare that soup for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you wasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.08,0:19:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that you're biting\Noff more than you can chew?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the customer here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm paying you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Full Body! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Full Body, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.72,0:19:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can your money truly satisfy your hunger?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:20:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? I'm asking\Ncan it satisfy your hunger?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting old you're never gonna\Nmake it if you don't just give in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's still no, no respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my! It's Sanji! What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever waste food around me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At sea, if you ever provoke your cook,\Nyou're signing your own death warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.18,0:21:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Customer service equals love\Nand love equals restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The customer is the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleasant greetings to the\Ncustomer is what it's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The customer is always right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we stand by that.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.81,0:21:34.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,478)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\t(3692,3733,\1a&HFF&)}Cook Patty\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 2,0:21:30.81,0:21:34.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,478)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\t(3692,3733,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Cook Patty\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 3,0:21:30.81,0:21:34.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,478)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Cook Patty\NSea Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn crooks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you ever come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all so pathetic. I laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today will be a great day for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello there and\Nwelcome, you damn crook.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our service motto around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The customer is our...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, our customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.10,0:21:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, not again, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ndoing to our customer?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.74,0:22:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see he's a marine lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a terrible cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.78,0:22:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think that\Nyou can talk to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.46,0:22:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crappy cook like you is calling me bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Restaurants can't exist\Nwithout their customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're our lifeblood, so we don't want to\Nhurt them the way you seem to keep doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he deserved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't treat the\Nfood or me with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he insulted all the cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I simply taught him a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you, no restaurant should\Ntreat its customers like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.94,0:22:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll shut you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.48,0:22:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will shut you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.54,0:22:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This entire place!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.12,0:22:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole restaurant is\Nfinished! Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.72,0:22:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, maybe I should\Njust finish you off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.30,0:23:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arrogant assholes like you\Nwho think they're such big
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shots they can push anybody\Naround really piss me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't keep doing this in\Nthe restaurant every other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not such a big\Nshot now, are ya? Are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.32,0:23:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can breathe again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss Zef, what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.22,0:23:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't hurt yourself, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another thing that's gonna have\Nto get fixed because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.72,0:23:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You attacked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.76,0:23:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, can you stop messing\Naround and give us a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.86,0:23:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji's gone crazy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.82,0:23:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.84,0:23:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you went on another\Nrampage in here, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.38,0:23:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put a cork in it, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.52,0:23:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now you're ordering me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.72,0:23:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.64,0:23:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to sink my restaurant\Nto the bottom of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.46,0:23:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two, get your ass\Nout of my restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.78,0:24:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of restaurant is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.38,0:24:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boss is like a gangster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.78,0:24:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.98,0:24:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if this were a pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.36,0:24:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you deny our customer is king?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.66,0:24:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only kingly customers are the ones\Nwho stomach the slop that you call food.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.70,0:24:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.61,0:24:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you two want to fight,\Nyou'll keep it in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.46,0:24:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.00,0:24:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are all these idiots really cooks?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.68,0:24:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.59,0:24:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Fullbody!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.46,0:24:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.58,0:24:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this restaurant is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, he's escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.98,0:24:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate Creek's henchman\Nattacked us and vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.58,0:24:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He what? Well, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.38,0:24:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've already lost seven of\Nour men and the only thing
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.38,0:24:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we wanted out of him was\Na lead on fighting Creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.96,0:24:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.87,0:24:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we picked him up three days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.52,0:24:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was right on the verge\Nof starving to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.36,0:24:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we haven't fed him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.98,0:25:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did he get the strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.36,0:25:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greek pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.72,0:25:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who are said to be\Nthe fiercest pirates in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.22,0:25:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Lieutenant, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.32,0:25:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would seem we have a new customer, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.96,0:25:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It do well to mind his manners and\Nnot start any trouble on my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.36,0:25:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.68,0:25:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.52,0:25:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just bring me something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.46,0:25:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, this is a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.96,0:25:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello and welcome, you damn crook!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.32,0:25:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna say this one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.46,0:25:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and bring me something\Nto eat and make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.76,0:26:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cook is gonna get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.98,0:26:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.30,0:26:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but might I be so bold to inquire\Nhow you're paying for your meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.94,0:26:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will a bullet be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.66,0:26:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you don't have any money then?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.04,0:26:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dumbass Patty broke into the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.90,0:26:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what power.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.00,0:26:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pirate, but our policy is\Nto only serve paying customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.22,0:26:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick his ass, Paddy! Show that, pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.84,0:26:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cooks don't screw around!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can hear your stomach\Ngrumbling from here, pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.50,0:26:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a fart, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.52,0:26:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen, get me something to eat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.80,0:26:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not getting you\Nanything, so beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.94,0:26:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.06,0:26:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of these cooks are insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.10,0:26:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.98,0:26:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want anything to do\Nwith this place ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.76,0:26:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick him! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.96,0:27:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, you damn crooks!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.52,0:27:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need anything, just ask, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.48,0:27:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please, never come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.58,0:27:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.49,0:27:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I wasn't so weak from\Nhunger, I'd be inside eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.78,0:27:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How beautiful and cruel this ocean can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost a death sentence to\Nlose your food and water out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.32,0:27:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How difficult it is to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.10,0:27:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what it means to go hungry\Nbecause of the sea more than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.82,0:27:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can die for your pride if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.68,0:28:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But listen, if you eat and survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.00,0:28:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't that give you the\Nopportunity to fight for
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.74,0:28:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pride truly worth having\Nnow and in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.44,0:28:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.84,0:28:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.14,0:28:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.42,0:28:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.00,0:28:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I truly thought I was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.74,0:28:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fruit, it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.60,0:28:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never eaten food this good before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.64,0:28:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.92,0:28:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I just found my cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.10,0:28:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky he gave you food.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't looking so good there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.06,0:28:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a goner. So listen, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.94,0:29:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cook, why don't you leave\Nthis boat and join my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.50,0:29:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could use a cook like\Nyou on my pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.76,0:29:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.06,0:29:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.34,0:29:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.52,0:29:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.42,0:29:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.60,0:29:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.36,0:29:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.08,0:29:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.56,0:29:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.02,0:29:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever\Nchanges, I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.00,0:30:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can return to the time\Nwhen everything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.22,0:30:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.28,0:30:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

